{"id":"u-b220fe76-e491-4d06-9fec-f2a169bc54d2","src":"community","title":"Norwegian 4-Day Powerlifting Program","author":"liftingodyssey","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/gowScA-norwegian-5-day-powerlifting-program-1","desc":"Norwegian 4-Day Powerlifting Program (12 Weeks)\nHigh-frequency program inspired by Dietmar Wolf and the Norwegian IPF team. Squat and bench are trained 4× per week (with competition lifts + variations), deadlift 2–3× per week (1 heavy, 1–2 light/variant). The program runs in 3 phases:\n\nPhase 1 (Weeks 1–4, Volume): Build base with 65–75% loads, 4–6 reps, high frequency, moderate assistance.\n\nPhase 2 (Weeks 5–8, Intensification): Wave loading, alternating lighter and heavier weeks. Loads climb to ~85–90%, assistance volume reduced.\n\nPhase 3 (Weeks 9–12, Peaking): High intensity (85–95%), lower volume, focus on competition lifts. Week 11 taper, Week 12 PR test/competition.","level":["Advanced"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":150,"joins":10,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-04-05T20:23:23.872Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":40},{"r":3,"pct":55},{"r":2,"pct":65},{"r":5,"pct":70,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":40},{"r":3,"pct":55},{"r":2,"pct":60},{"r":5,"pct":65,"x":5}],"note":"1st rep paused"},{"n":"Deficit Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":30},{"r":3,"pct":35},{"r":2,"pct":45},{"r":6,"pct":55,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"pct":35},{"r":8,"pct":45},{"r":8,"pct":60,"x":3}]},{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":30,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Paused)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":30},{"r":3,"pct":40},{"r":2,"pct":50},{"r":6,"pct":60,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":40},{"r":5,"pct":55},{"r":5,"pct":60},{"r":5,"pct":70,"x":4}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl (Dumb